  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can charge your ranged attacks with ki, giving them additional damage potential.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wis 13, Point Blank Shot.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While ki focused, your ranged attacks deal an extra +1point of damage per ki point invested.</p>\n<p>Expend your ki focus with a single ranged attack to deal an extra +1d6 points of damage per ki point. You must decide to expend your ki focus prior to making an attack. If your attack misses, you still expend your ki focus and any ki points used.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
